  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e on a .pas fixture: Self.Get, A.Run() and TA.Create emit no edge; external cdecl CExt and typecast PAnsiChar(s) each emit an unresolved calls edge; no symbol for TA = class or TRec = record. All four points reproduce; pascal.py call/symbol code unchanged since the item's baseline (52dcff2fa3/bbcb174a01). MECHANISM: _get_call_name reads a bare identifier callee only; Pass 1 emits no symbol for external declProc or class/record types, so typecasts cannot be told from calls. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fidih."  # 720b
